                    "fix": "In the collapsed header, show only the person's own label if one exists, otherwise the city ('Camas, WA'), plus the ScopeChip. Show street labels only inside the open 'Show for' menu. Rewrite the INSTEAD OF line to: \"Instead of any street name in the header, draw the place's own label or its city — because a street plus a pin and a distance narrows the home to a few houses in a shared screenshot.\" Update frames 1, 2, 3, 13, 14 and 15 to match, and add a Notes line saying the menu (not the header) carries street labels."
