                    "evidence": "f9 prompt: \"On Android, change only the mover row. This change has no Android verify sheet or success screen to edit.\" inventory f3b-verify-address-sheet: \"iOS and Android have only an inline verify banner and need the sheet itself\"; v1 f3b frames: \"method picker, pending, non-owner-blocked on Android\". Inventory uxNote: \"the native mirrors will silently keep the old names\".",
                    "fix": "Replace the Android sentence with: \"On Android, the verify sheet is drawn by the verify sheet prompt; here, apply the same lists to it and change the mover row.\" Add an artboard \"f9-verification-promise-copy · android · NN-verify-sheet-list · light\" (the expanded list with the Also-once-you-verify block) and one Android success step. Renumber, and rebalance the batch plan so no turn has more than 6 artboards."
