                "issues": [
                  {
                    "severity": "major",
                    "issue": "The saved-place collision copy is wrong. The design doc limits a place to one row per KIND. The prompt's caption says 'one per place', which tells a saved-place user they can hold only one date at the whole address.",
                    "evidence": "first-person-loop-design-2026-09-16.md F5: 'One row per kind per place in v1 ... the UI says \"one per kind for now\"'. derive-proposals f5-add-date-sheet: \"Say it in the picker ('Warranty ends — already set for Nov 2')\". The prompt instead has: \"At a saved place, say it before typing, under the tile: 'One per place for now · already set'\".",
                    "fix": "Change the under-tile caption to use the doc's wording plus the existing value, e.g. 'Warranty ends — already set for Sat 12 Dec · one per kind for now'."
                  },
                  {
                    "severity": "major",
                    "issue": "The prompt drops the unverified-seed variant. The design doc seeds tax_appeal as 'unverified' until it is checked, and the voter flow and voter proposal both require a hollow mark (or badge) plus the source. The prompt draws every seeded row as Official, and its only mention of the unverified case is a Notes assumption, so the default state of the F12 seed is never drawn.",
                    "evidence": "Design doc F12: 'Seed county-scoped AddressCalendarRule rows of kind tax_appeal ... confidence 'unverified' until checked'. flows-spec flow-13 failure branch: 'Unverified seed. A hollow mark plus the source.' derive-proposals f6-voter-step-sheet states: 'ready, confidence unverified — badge + 'not yet checked against the state site''. f12-calendar-event-detail-sheet states: 'official seeded, unverified (source + caveat + report action) · official seeded, verified (caveat dropped)'. Inventory visualization: 'Seeded mode shows the hollow provenance mark beside the date'. The prompt's Notes say: 'seeded rows drawn Official because they were checked against the authority'.",
                    "fix": "Add a frame (or a clearly labelled variant of frame 6): the tax appeal seed unverified, with a hollow mark, 'On record, not confirmed', the caption 'not yet checked against Clark County Board of Equalization', and 'This isn't right' live. State that the filled mark is used only once the seed has been checked."
                  },
                  {
