                    "fix": "Add to PEOPLE: “This section hosts the household block (its own prompt). When only the owner lives here it shows ‘Who lives here with you?’ with Invite by email / Share a link / Just me. With 2+ people it collapses to the MemberRow line drawn here. ‘Just me’ is a FactRow declined state with Undo.” Mention it on Notes as the reason no block is drawn in frame 1."
