                    "fix": "Define once, in WHO AND WHEN: \"'Saved place' frames (PLACE B, not claimed)\", and replace 'T1' with 'saved place' throughout. Replace 'The other F6 steps' with 'The other moving steps'. Delete '(its own prompt)' and '(formerly …)'. Fold WHY ONE LIST into THE ONE JOB as two sentences. Use 'rule=lease-notice' in both URLs. Name the last artboard 'x-place-file · notes · 22-notes · light'."
