                    "evidence": "contract LockedActionRow: \"pending (no link: 'We're checking your postcard code — expected Sep 19–26')\" vs prompt \"with a text action 'Enter your code'\"; \"Postcard mailed Sun 18 Oct\"; contract DateRow: \"The title names the action for deadlines\"; contract TextActionRow outbound: \"a bordered row with an external-link glyph\"; flows-spec flow-03: \"The landing falls back with 'That date was removed' and never shows a blank screen.\"",
