                    "evidence": "house-style-v2.txt FIXTURES: \"PLACE B ... Saved by Jordan Lee, 36, who moved from Portland, OR on Fri 9 Oct and saved it on Sat 10 Oct.\" TODAY is \"Mon 19 Oct 2026\". component-contract.md FirstWeekRow: \"The window matches the activation window (7 days).\" The prompt says: \"Someone new saved PLACE B two days ago\", \"PLACE B only, day 2 of 7\", and in frame 13 (Maya) \"Today now uses Larkspur Loop. Birchfield Ct is still saved.\"",
