                    "evidence": "flows-spec flow-03 step 9: \"f1-today-tab | 5 · claimed home (first open after accept) + one-time notice (proposed) | Today reads 'Today now uses Maple St · because you joined this household'...\" flows-spec line 497: \"f1-today-tab has no frame for the first open after accept, when HomeOccupancy silently switches Today to the new home.\" The prompt's artboard 22 lists \"the unshown joined-household notice frame\".",
