                    "fix": "Change the Air caption to 'AirNow · nearest monitors · observed 7:00 AM — 11 hours ago'. Draw the air mark at 50% opacity (the ProvenanceMark stale variant). Spell out 'air quality index (AQI)' once, in the row label: 'Air quality index (AQI) today'. Add 'stale air row' to FOUNDATIONS COMPONENTS USED and EDGE CASES. Add a Notes line: 'Assumption: an AirNow reading older than 3 hours is stale; the fixture's 7:00 AM reading is therefore shown with its age.'"
