                    "fix": "Add: 'Rows reading \"Not on record\" carry no mark. \"FEMA hasn't mapped flood hazard here\" and \"Non-burnable land cover (USFS)\" keep the filled mark, because they are the authority's own statements.' Give their spoken labels, for example 'Flood zone: FEMA hasn't mapped flood hazard here. FEMA. Official.'"
