                    "evidence": "Prompt: \"Caption: 'EPA · county-wide estimate — only a test tells you about this home'\". House invariant 5: \"authority · scope · as-of\". Foundations 00c-08 crop: \"SourceCaption 'EPA · county-wide · as of 1993 map'\".",
