                    "issue": "Flow-13 sends a saved-place mover (Jordan, T1) to this Civic block, but the page is home-gated. Notes raises only the compare-strip case and does not propose where flow-13's step 3 should land.",
                    "evidence": "flows-spec flow-13 step 3: \"f6-place-section-details | ready (civic registration block)\" for Jordan at T1. Prompt: \"A saved place (PLACE B) cannot open this page today; flag it on Notes.\"",
                    "fix": "Add to Notes: 'Flow-13 step 3 is unreachable at T1. Proposed: for a saved place, the place file's voter row opens the DateSheet in view-seeded voter mode, which carries the same two method lines and the VoteWA row, until Civic accepts saved places.'"
