                    "issue": "The manifest has no web-390 Civic frame, although the registration block, banner and polling card wrap differently at 390. The URLs also use template placeholders.",
                    "evidence": "Artboards list web-390 only for \"01-risk-dense\". \"Native: pantopus://place/{home}/civic.\"",
                    "fix": "Add 'f6-place-section-details · web-390 · 02-civic-dense · light — the Civic stack at 390 with the bottom tab bar' after artboard 7, renumber, and add it to Turn 2. Write the deep link as 'pantopus://place/home-a/civic (HOME A's id)'."
