                    "evidence": "house-style-v2.txt: 'Pending invite: priya@example.com, expires Mon 26 Oct.' critique-findings.md: 'a \"Household\" block that carries the who-lives-here prompt, the member count and the pending-invite row'. component-contract.md InviteRow 'Used in: f3-members-roster, x-place-file…'. Prompt: '7. … 07-collapsed-roster … Maya after Sam joined: only \"Maya and Sam live here · View\".'",
                    "fix": "Change artboard 7 to: 'Maya after Sam joined: \"Maya and Sam live here · View\" plus the InviteRow \"priya@example.com · Member · sent Mon 12 Oct · Expires Mon 26 Oct · Resend\" (managers only). No ask card.'"
