                    "evidence": "flows-spec.md flow-04 step 3: 'Expires Sep 30, 2026' for an invite sent Sep 16. component-contract.md InviteRow: 'Member · sent Sep 9 · Expires Sep 23'. Prompt: 'sam.ortega@example.com · Member · sent Mon 5 Oct · Expires Mon 12 Oct'.",
