                    "evidence": "derive-proposals.md f3-who-lives-here-card: 'error: the dismiss PATCH fails — keep the card, retry silently, never optimistically vanish'. Prompt: 'A save that fails keeps \"Just you, then. · Undo\" on screen, retries quietly'.",
