                    "fix": "Name them, for example \"Lena Park, guest\" (frame 06) and \"Sam as a legacy read-only member\" (frame 05), and list any new name on Notes. State \"Frame 06: October 2026 · 5 items\" and \"Frame 17: November 2026 · 9 items\"."
                  },
