                    "fix": "Add one sentence to WHO AND WHEN: \"Frames 1–4 and 6–15 show Jordan using 'Compare with a friend' under his own aha card, sending to a different friend. Frame 5 is the flow's reciprocal step, reached from 'Send yours back', with the toggle off.\" Add this to the Notes assumptions."
