                    "fix": "Add to LAYOUT: \"One status line sits between the pair and the caption. It holds either the offline reason 'You're offline. Compare needs a connection.', 'Link copied', or the InlineErrorRow. The two-sentence caption always stays below it.\" Then fix EDGE CASES, which says the error takes \"the caption's slot\", to match."
