                    "evidence": "00c-08 S2: \"a 12pt spinner ... replaces the start of the label, which reads 'Making a link…'\". The prompt says: \"If it takes 1s or longer, a 12pt spinner appears at the start of the label\" and \"Copying shows \\\"Link copied\\\" under the pair\" (Android frame 12).",
                    "fix": "Write \"the spinner replaces the start of the label\". Record the 1s delay on Notes as a surface delta (P11: no indicator under 1s). In frame 12, annotate: \"Android 13+ also shows the system clipboard confirmation; keep the inline line for older versions and for screen readers\". Alternatively, draw the system confirmation and drop the inline line on 13+."
