                    "evidence": "\"10. f8-seasonal-aha · web-390 · 10-no-program-link · light — the Mon 19 Oct voter card with the annotation \\\"state has no program link\\\"\". The inventory lists \"no program_url for the state (headline only, no link)\", and derive-proposals says \"radon follow-up with no program_url for the state → no link, headline only\".",
                    "fix": "Redraw frame 10 as the Mon 11 Jan 2027 radon card with no outbound row, annotated \"hypothetical Zone 1 county in a state with no program link\"."
                  },
                  {
