                    "evidence": "\"Detail: \\\"Moved from Sat 31 Oct, a Saturday.\\\"\" · \"Hazard cards: the existing reading chip ... shaped like StatusChip\" · WHO AND WHEN: \"a signed-out visitor who recently moved from Oregon\"",
                    "fix": "Change the detail to \"Moved from Sat 31 Oct because that date is a Saturday.\" Add to Notes: \"reading chip = surface-specific neutral pill, StatusChip geometry, not a published component\" and \"visitor is an unnamed newcomer, not Jordan Lee\"."
