                    "evidence": "inventory-entries/f7-today-widget.json states: \"no place ('Save an address to see today here' — only where the add-a-place sheet exists)\". critique-findings.md: 'Until it exists, the widget must not advertise \"Save an address to see today here\" on Android.' Prompt: 'Someone with no place sees \"Save an address to see today here\"' with no condition.",
                    "fix": "Add to EDGE CASES and Notes: 'The no-place copy ships only once the signed-in Add a place sheet exists on that platform. Until then, show \"Open Pantopus to see today at your address\".'"
