                    "evidence": "house-style-v2 invariant 4: \"A failed check names the provider and offers Retry.\" The prompt: \"Unavailable: no mood word, \"Couldn't check what's due.\" and \"Retry\".\"",
                    "fix": "Say that the host QuietDayReceipt or InlineErrorRow names the failed input (e.g. \"Couldn't reach your bills\"), or note on Notes why the keeper line stays generic."
